## Context
Reviewers: Exp2 lacks a pure-RAG (non-agentic) baseline to isolate the agentic
contribution; tests only four cloud-API agents (no browser surfaces, local models,
or multi-agent frameworks); fusion is naive (union / 2-of-4) and ignores correlated
sources. Multilingual (Vietnamese-doc) and temporal (as-of-2018) arms would test
key assumptions. Tracker: 0644.

## Actions
1. Add a pure-RAG baseline with the same document set (isolate the agentic contribution).
2. Broaden the agent set (browser surfaces / local models / multi-agent) as feasible.
3. Test sophisticated fusion (confidence-weighted vote, capture–recapture) that
   accounts for correlated sources.
4. Optional: multilingual and temporal-query arms.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Exp2 extended with a RAG baseline + advanced fusion; the agentic contribution isolated
